> **Description (Q3b):** Instead of detecting keypoints I place a regular 4 x 4 grid, centres at 16, 48, 80, 112 (step 32), each keypoint with size 32 and angle 0, and call `sift.compute`. Every image now gives 16 descriptors x 128 values = **2048** features, equal to my by-hand formula, so all images have the same fixed length.

